	(gr_text "KEY: User.2 = Adafruit 2090 module · User.Drawings = our battery/speaker/LRA/IMU · User.Eco1 = GBA shell, screen (dashed = 61.2 x 40.8 active), controls, grille, 2xAA door (dashed) · dashed rings = handling buffers"
