		)
	)
	(gr_text "DEPTH: cell sits IN the board cutout under the 2090 (module back is 11 above the board; 8.5 cell + 2.65 module parts fit) -> 2090 glass 16.7 above board + 1.6 PCB + ~1 back-side parts + ~3 shells = ~22 mm vs GBA 24.5"
